WEBVTT

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:18.650
So, your promise.

00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:21.530
Tell me about my sister.

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:28.780
She was in my class.

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:32.940
At the same school where
your teacher committed suicide?

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:34.820
No, a different one.

00:00:34.820 --> 00:00:39.230
After that happened,
I was transferred to another school.

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:42.940
That was where I met Elena.

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:54.730
She was such a good person.

00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:02.860
Transferring schools and my teacher's suicide
made me distance myself from others,

00:01:02.860 --> 00:01:06.230
but she seemed determined
to strike up a conversation with me.

00:01:08.190 --> 00:01:12.440
She helped me feel less alone,
even just a little.

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:15.860
I felt like I could really trust her.

00:01:15.860 --> 00:01:19.570
I mean, I might have
had some ulterior motives...

00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:23.280
Didn't need to know that...

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:27.400
That's why I find it difficult
to believe what you're saying.

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:33.150
Would Elena really kill her parents
and murder countless others?

00:03:12.230 --> 00:03:15.440
Lame. Only 2,000 yen.

00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:20.110
Do you think the person that
dropped this was looking for coins?

00:03:20.110 --> 00:03:24.320
Get rid of it. Don't get distracted.

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:28.150
We're after bigger prey.

00:03:28.150 --> 00:03:30.530
What?

00:03:30.530 --> 00:03:34.730
Are you giving me orders? I'll kill you.

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:38.650
Stop, Subaru.

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:49.440
I'm tired. I'm going home.

00:03:49.440 --> 00:03:52.650
Don't get upset with him. He's still a child.

00:03:52.650 --> 00:03:54.280
I know.

00:03:54.280 --> 00:04:01.480
We won't be able to complete
our goals without his help.

00:04:05.940 --> 00:04:09.230
Not here. Let's keep on going.

00:04:09.230 --> 00:04:10.900
Okay.

00:04:13.320 --> 00:04:15.110
Hey, Shuichi.

00:04:15.110 --> 00:04:19.650
You said there were dangerous people
in these mountains, right?

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:22.860
Have you ever run into one of them?

00:04:29.480 --> 00:04:30.530
Yes.

00:04:30.530 --> 00:04:34.480
So you have! What should we do
if we see one?! Please tell me!

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:36.030
To tell the truth, I haven't--

00:04:36.030 --> 00:04:37.860
I killed her.

00:04:43.110 --> 00:04:44.400
What?

00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:48.940
On the day I first went to Clair's apartment,

00:04:48.940 --> 00:04:51.610
some woman attacked us out of nowhere...

00:04:51.610 --> 00:04:55.030
We fought, and...

00:04:56.650 --> 00:04:58.190
It can't be true.

00:04:58.190 --> 00:05:03.690
You... You wouldn't kill another person...

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:06.570
Oh, I get it! She did it, didn't she?

00:05:06.570 --> 00:05:09.780
While she was inside you, like I am now!

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:14.150
No. I'm the one that killed her.

00:05:14.150 --> 00:05:21.320
I didn't stop Clair.
And I knew what she was going to do.

00:05:27.320 --> 00:05:28.860
What?

00:05:28.860 --> 00:05:30.860
That smell...

00:05:32.190 --> 00:05:36.570
She's not alone. There are two... Three!

00:05:36.570 --> 00:05:42.070
I don't believe it!
Are these Clair's sister's friends?!

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:43.980
I can tell by the smell alone--

00:05:43.980 --> 00:05:46.730
They are on a completely different level!

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:52.400
Their power... There's no way
we could match them!

00:05:54.280 --> 00:05:58.650
My wallet's scent is coming from them?

00:06:00.650 --> 00:06:05.440
What should we do? My ID is in there...

00:06:05.440 --> 00:06:08.610
What if they come to my house?

00:06:08.610 --> 00:06:14.820
Hey, Shuichi... They're not bad people, right?

00:06:16.190 --> 00:06:22.480
This strength... They're her allies.
If we make one wrong move...

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:29.730
Hey, do you think I should
tell my parents to run away?

00:06:29.730 --> 00:06:31.780
Am I overthinking it?

00:06:34.280 --> 00:06:36.780
Let's go after them.

00:06:36.780 --> 00:06:40.820
We can't do that! What if they find us?!

00:06:40.820 --> 00:06:47.110
It's okay. I will save you.

00:06:50.570 --> 00:06:53.780
Sorry, we had a lot to talk about.

00:06:53.780 --> 00:07:00.690
But the pact is complete.
This girl... Clair is now one of us.

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:02.030
Glad to be a part of the team!

00:07:02.030 --> 00:07:05.690
You finished the pact!
So we can talk to her now, right?

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:09.570
My name is Yota Murakami.
I'm 19, no real job yet.

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:12.070
I'm into music, and I'm looking for a girlfr--

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:14.610
Hey, where is Shuichi?

00:07:16.070 --> 00:07:19.570
Your friend ran off somewhere
with Yoshioka--the girl with the helmet--

00:07:19.570 --> 00:07:22.280
and they haven't come back.

00:07:22.280 --> 00:07:25.860
Why? Do they know each other?

00:07:25.860 --> 00:07:27.320
I don't think so.

00:07:27.320 --> 00:07:30.610
My bad, I should have stopped them.

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:35.400
They said they'd be back soon,
that they were going on a walk.

00:07:35.400 --> 00:07:41.730
That stupid girl. Who cares about her? She's--

00:07:38.730 --> 00:07:41.730
Hey, you.

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:45.070
Do you know where Shuichi went?

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:54.980
That's crazy, you can record video.
You're like a real camera.

00:07:54.980 --> 00:07:56.730
Convenient for a voyeur, eh?

00:07:56.730 --> 00:08:00.530
Shut up! I'm just into making movies!
I followed them because--

00:08:00.530 --> 00:08:06.070
I don't care why you did.
I just want to know where Shuichi is.

00:08:06.070 --> 00:08:08.070
Show me the rest.

00:08:15.400 --> 00:08:20.860
That's where I stopped recording.
I lost them after that.

00:08:20.860 --> 00:08:22.940
I see.

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:27.190
Please excuse me,
I'm going to go look for Shuichi.

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:28.860
Hold on.

00:08:28.860 --> 00:08:33.860
They're not back, and we haven't
heard from them for over an hour--

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:37.690
There's a good chance
they're in some kind of trouble.

00:08:37.690 --> 00:08:41.110
Surely you realize that.

00:08:41.110 --> 00:08:45.230
I don't care. It's not like
I'm going to bother you guys.

00:08:45.230 --> 00:08:48.780
I thought you were a bit more well behaved...

00:08:48.780 --> 00:08:53.530
Although I like that you
won't abandon your friend.

00:08:53.530 --> 00:08:55.280
Let's give her an escort.

00:08:55.280 --> 00:09:01.030
Not that we have a lot of
natural fighters in our group.

00:09:01.030 --> 00:09:07.190
There is one though. Yota, do you mind?

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:08.070
Not at all.

00:09:08.070 --> 00:09:09.440
What?

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:12.940
You're not just some ugly dude
that turns handsome?

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:14.610
Who are you calling ugly?!

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:16.440
Hey, she said--

00:09:16.440 --> 00:09:21.440
I told you. We don't talk about our allies'
secrets to anyone who isn't an ally.

00:09:21.440 --> 00:09:25.980
Anyhow, I'll leave it to you two.
This is our problem, too.

00:09:25.980 --> 00:09:31.980
Yoshioka is one of us.
And of course, you are too.

00:09:35.190 --> 00:09:38.730
It was the same then.
My weakness caused her death.

00:09:39.980 --> 00:09:43.360
I was so scared.
Only worried about saving myself.

00:09:44.440 --> 00:09:47.820
But I won't run away anymore!

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:50.980
No matter who I have to face!
No matter what happens!

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:56.190
The scents have split.

00:09:56.440 --> 00:10:00.650
The one with the wallet is alone!

00:10:00.650 --> 00:10:02.820
This might work out!

00:10:02.820 --> 00:10:05.230
What might?

00:10:05.230 --> 00:10:06.860
Do you want something?

00:10:08.150 --> 00:10:11.070
A kid?! When did he--?!

00:10:11.070 --> 00:10:16.610
Hey. You called me a kid, huh?
You trying to make fun of me?

00:10:16.610 --> 00:10:19.860
Uh... I'm looking for my wallet...

00:10:19.860 --> 00:10:22.190
You piss me off.

00:10:25.780 --> 00:10:27.730
Little shits...

00:10:29.820 --> 00:10:31.030
Wha--

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:38.530
Die.

00:10:39.440 --> 00:10:45.570
No matter who I have to face.
No matter what happens.

00:10:49.230 --> 00:10:55.650
I promised... I'd save you...

00:10:57.480 --> 00:11:01.030
Father, Mother. That's enough.

00:11:05.440 --> 00:11:07.690
Squashed!

00:11:15.530 --> 00:11:18.230
Hey, you want to go out with me?

00:11:18.230 --> 00:11:19.690
Fuck off.

00:11:19.690 --> 00:11:22.820
You're totally my type, Clairy!

00:11:22.820 --> 00:11:26.360
Don't call me that, creep. Fuck off.

00:11:26.360 --> 00:11:30.530
Wait, is that really your actual face?

00:11:30.530 --> 00:11:35.150
Why didn't you hide your face
when you first met us?

00:11:36.280 --> 00:11:40.070
I don't have any reason to hide it.

00:11:40.070 --> 00:11:45.230
I don't have family or anyone else
that I need to keep secrets from.

00:11:45.230 --> 00:11:49.110
You seemed a bit timid when I first saw you.

00:11:49.110 --> 00:11:53.480
I was just worried.

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:57.110
I'm the only one in
the group that can fight, right?

00:11:57.110 --> 00:12:03.190
If something were to happen,
would I be able to protect them by myself?

00:12:07.360 --> 00:12:08.940
Nope.

00:12:10.610 --> 00:12:13.480
I know I don't look impressive,
but I'm pretty strong!

00:12:13.480 --> 00:12:15.230
I still don't think so.

00:12:15.230 --> 00:12:20.820
There are crazy monsters in these mountains,
things you can't even imagine.

00:12:22.320 --> 00:12:27.030
You didn't have the same
fearsome scent that they did.

00:12:27.030 --> 00:12:28.650
Scent, huh?

00:12:28.650 --> 00:12:32.780
Okay, so why did you join
a team of weaklings like us?

00:12:34.320 --> 00:12:39.690
Anyone would have been fine.
You happened to be the first ones I met.

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:42.440
I just wanted information.

00:12:42.440 --> 00:12:46.570
I also thought it'd be easy
to use a bunch of clowns like you.

00:12:47.650 --> 00:12:51.400
Yeah, that's what I'm talking about!
You're so cool, totally my type!

00:12:51.400 --> 00:12:53.980
Shut up. Fuck off.

00:12:53.980 --> 00:12:58.190
Wait, so is that costume guy your boyfriend?

00:12:58.190 --> 00:12:59.110
No.

00:12:59.110 --> 00:13:00.530
Oh!

00:13:00.530 --> 00:13:05.440
It's more than that. He's my other half.

00:13:10.860 --> 00:13:14.780
Shuichi and I. We two are one.

00:13:14.780 --> 00:13:18.190
Wait for me, Shuichi. I'll be there soon.

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:28.320
Little shits. Not even worth my time.

00:13:32.780 --> 00:13:35.280
Hey, Shuichi.

00:13:37.400 --> 00:13:41.730
Maybe the form you take means something.

00:13:45.610 --> 00:13:47.400
It's frustrating.

00:13:53.070 --> 00:13:56.610
Why are we so weak?

00:13:58.940 --> 00:14:02.320
It frustrates you, too... Doesn't it?

00:14:07.820 --> 00:14:11.030
What an incredible idea!

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:15.940
Letting someone inside of you
to make up for your own weakness.

00:14:19.190 --> 00:14:21.690
What the hell is this?

00:14:36.110 --> 00:14:37.690
What is it?

00:14:37.690 --> 00:14:42.030
I'm worried about Subaru.
I'm going to go check on him.

00:14:42.030 --> 00:14:47.070
I doubt there's anyone around
here that could harm him.

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:52.030
You're right. Still... He's only a kid.

00:14:56.400 --> 00:15:00.070
What was that scream?

00:15:00.070 --> 00:15:01.820
Let's go.

00:15:05.030 --> 00:15:08.980
Seriously? How cool.

00:15:08.980 --> 00:15:11.860
A metamorphosis, huh?

00:15:11.860 --> 00:15:13.480
You're still shit to me.

00:15:15.360 --> 00:15:17.570
Okay, fine.

00:15:17.570 --> 00:15:20.150
I was bored anyway.

00:15:21.280 --> 00:15:22.780
Let's have some fun.

00:15:37.230 --> 00:15:41.030
Huh. Are you a rare, like me?

00:15:42.980 --> 00:15:44.480
Still.

00:15:48.530 --> 00:15:52.110
I bet I'm rarer than you.

00:15:55.980 --> 00:15:59.690
The rage... It's welling up...

00:16:00.820 --> 00:16:06.530
I've never been so angry about
something that was done to me.

00:16:16.900 --> 00:16:18.530
Me?

00:16:21.820 --> 00:16:24.610
Who am I?

00:16:26.110 --> 00:16:29.440
Am I Shuichi Kagaya?

00:16:29.440 --> 00:16:33.150
Am I Chihiro Yoshioka?

00:16:33.150 --> 00:16:36.900
No. I am neither.

00:16:36.900 --> 00:16:40.650
But I know everything about her.

00:16:40.650 --> 00:16:45.530
Everything she's ever done.
What kind of person she was.

00:16:45.530 --> 00:16:47.150
And that is why...

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:50.980
...he must pay!

00:16:53.650 --> 00:16:58.820
He crushed her and threw her away,
like a worthless piece of trash...

00:17:14.940 --> 00:17:17.320
And that is my rage!

00:17:20.650 --> 00:17:23.360
Yoshioka feels it too.

00:17:23.360 --> 00:17:26.610
He treated me like trash. And now we rage!

00:17:28.360 --> 00:17:29.820
And now...

00:17:39.400 --> 00:17:42.730
The rage will burn!

00:17:46.780 --> 00:17:52.190
I want to kill this boy!

00:17:53.190 --> 00:17:56.030
Die!

00:18:00.780 --> 00:18:02.320
What...?

00:18:05.820 --> 00:18:07.900
Stay out of this, Elena! He's--

00:18:07.900 --> 00:18:13.190
Subaru. You have an important part to play.

00:18:13.190 --> 00:18:17.230
I don't want you to use that power here.

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:21.280
Fine.

00:18:35.530 --> 00:18:38.070
It's her.

00:18:38.070 --> 00:18:39.650
She's the enemy.

00:18:40.440 --> 00:18:43.030
She tried to kill Clair and I...

00:18:43.730 --> 00:18:46.360
And she turned me into a monster!

00:18:48.280 --> 00:18:49.860
I must stop her!

00:18:51.900 --> 00:18:57.820
Do I know this person?

00:18:57.820 --> 00:19:00.360
No...

00:19:01.650 --> 00:19:08.280
Is this... Shuichi's memory?

00:19:14.610 --> 00:19:18.900
I have to stop her...

00:19:18.900 --> 00:19:22.690
I have to stop this vile woman!

00:19:32.780 --> 00:19:34.280
Huh?

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:39.320
Why...?

00:19:53.570 --> 00:19:56.190
Ow, ow!

00:19:56.190 --> 00:20:00.480
Ah, I'm fine. Please don't be frightened.

00:20:00.480 --> 00:20:02.190
Thank you.

00:20:02.190 --> 00:20:06.650
You're the one who found this coin, aren't you?

00:20:08.780 --> 00:20:11.360
There's someone I want to be with!

00:20:11.360 --> 00:20:14.610
Ah, are you talking about... him?

00:20:14.610 --> 00:20:16.820
Yes.

00:20:16.820 --> 00:20:22.650
But even if I could be with him...

00:20:22.650 --> 00:20:28.610
I could never... Not again... Not him...

00:20:28.610 --> 00:20:32.400
So, this is the path you have chosen, huh?

00:20:42.650 --> 00:20:44.280
A dream.

00:20:44.280 --> 00:20:50.690
That's the first I've ever had.
Is it because of this body?

00:20:50.690 --> 00:20:52.690
I wonder just how long it's been.

00:20:52.690 --> 00:20:56.650
The seasons come and go.

00:20:56.650 --> 00:21:02.730
Time goes ticking by,
and the world keeps changing.

00:21:02.730 --> 00:21:10.230
It's truly fascinating. I feel like
I must watch where this all leads.

00:21:10.230 --> 00:21:13.280
Do you know those guys?

00:21:13.280 --> 00:21:14.980
No.

00:21:14.980 --> 00:21:21.440
Not that I care. But you
better not get in my way again.

00:21:21.440 --> 00:21:25.360
If you do... Nothing will stop me, not even you.

00:21:25.360 --> 00:21:29.860
Fine. You're welcome to try.

00:21:29.860 --> 00:21:31.690
Even if I'm killed...

00:21:31.690 --> 00:21:38.730
...I won't be allowed to die
until this is all over. It won't happen.

00:21:39.480 --> 00:21:42.570
I was out of line.

00:21:51.690 --> 00:21:54.690
What is this?

00:21:54.690 --> 00:21:57.360
What the hell happened here?

00:21:57.860 --> 00:22:02.480
Hey, stop! We still don't know
if there are enemies out here!

00:22:02.480 --> 00:22:04.190
Shuichi!

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:46.940
"Episode 8: Shadows in Memory"
